    <p>Long ago, North America was home to some of the most famous dinosaurs we know today. </p> 
    <p>In places like Montana and Utah, the mighty <strong><em>Tyrannosaurus rex</em></strong> and the three-horned <strong><em>Triceratops</em></strong> walked across open, grassy areas. 
        
